.TH "ABSSCTL" "1" "Oct 04, 2026" "0.1.5a3" "abssctl"
.SH NAME
abssctl \- Actual Budget sync-server admin CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.sp
\fBabssctl\fP [\fIOPTIONS\fP] \fICOMMAND\fP
.SH DESCRIPTION
.sp
\fBabssctl\fP installs and operates multiple Actual Budget sync\-server instances
on a TurnKey Linux host. It installs \fB@actual\-app/sync\-server\fP from npm,
renders systemd and nginx, and records instance state under \fB/var/lib/abssctl\fP\&.
.sp
Actual 25.11 and newer require Node.js 22 or newer. Use \fBabssctl node ensure\fP
to install that runtime. \fBabssctl\fP does not talk to budget data; that is
\fB@actual\-app/cli\fP\&.
.SH COMMANDS
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
\fBversion\fP
Install, switch, uninstall, and list sync\-server releases.
.TP
\fBinstance\fP
Create, start, stop, and reconfigure instances.
.TP
\fBbackup\fP
Create, verify, restore, and prune instance archives.
.TP
\fBtls\fP
Verify and install certificates used by nginx.
.TP
\fBdoctor\fP
Run health probes and optional repairs.
.TP
\fBsupport\-bundle\fP
Collect a redacted diagnostic archive.
.TP
\fBnode ensure\fP
Install the Node.js version required by the selected Actual release.
.TP
\fBsystem init\fP
Create the service account and directory layout.
.TP
\fBdocs man\fP
Print or install this manual page.
.TP
\fBcompletion\fP
Show, install, or remove shell completion scripts.
.UNINDENT
.SH EXIT STATUS
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 2
Validation or user input error.
.TP
.B 3
Environment error (permissions, missing tools, disk).
.TP
.B 4
Provider or system failure (systemd, nginx, TLS, tar).
.UNINDENT
